# Unleash feature flags

This service runs an Unleash server, a dedicated PostgreSQL database, and Unleash Edge.

- Use the module-visible `admin` endpoint for the UI and admin API.
- Send client SDK evaluation traffic only to the public `edge` endpoint.
- Store `POSTGRES_PASSWORD`, `UNLEASH_ADMIN_TOKEN`, and `UNLEASH_CLIENT_TOKEN` in Codefly secret configuration.
